<title>JAPAN: Nippon Conlux -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Conlux -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.56		vs	    9.76</p>
<p> Operating	  664    million	  vs	  399    million</p>
<p> Current	    701    million	  vs	  857    million</p>
<p> Net		  248    million	  vs	  623    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.68 yen	  vs	   14.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     44 million	  vs	  44 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Conlux Co Ltd makes coin mechanisms for coin vending machines.</p>
</text>
